<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Employee COVID-19 Vaccination Verification/Exemption Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 8px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .form-label {
    font-weight: normal;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px; /* Adjust as needed for alignment */
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    min-width: 200px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Western Oregon UNIVERSITY</div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 11pt;">Human Resources</div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <span data-field="contact_info_line1">{{ contact_info_line1 }}</span> | 
    <span data-field="contact_info_phone1">{{ contact_info_phone1 }}</span> | 
    <span data-field="contact_info_phone2">{{ contact_info_phone2 }}</span> | 
    <span data-field="contact_info_email">{{ contact_info_email }}</span> | 
    <span data-field="contact_info_website">{{ contact_info_website }}</span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="header-title">Employee COVID-19 Vaccination Verification/Exemption Form</h1>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
    In order to protect the health and safety of our community, Western Oregon University requires all students and employees to be vaccinated against COVID-19. To report your vaccination status or if you would like to request an exemption from this vaccine requirement, please complete this form and return it to Human Resources via the 
    <a href="#" style="color: blue;">Human Resources Form Submission Portal Channel</a>.
  </p>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 1: Employee Name and Identifying Information</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Employee Name</td>
      <td class="input-field"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Department/Division</td>
      <td class="input-field"><span data-field="department_division">{{ department_division }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Supervisor Name</td>
      <td class="input-field"><span data-field="supervisor_name">{{ supervisor_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>University ID</td>
      <td class="input-field"><span data-field="university_id">{{ university_id }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Employee Classification</td>
      <td class="input-field"><span data-field="employee_classification">{{ employee_classification }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 2: Vaccination Status (Only if Reporting Vaccination Status)</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
    Please attach a copy of your vaccination record to this form.
  </p>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="vaccination_attached">
    <label for="vaccination_attached" style="font-size: 10pt;">I have attached a copy of my vaccination record to this form.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 3: Exemption Status (Only If Requesting an Exemption)</div>
  
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Medical Exemption</p>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="medical_exemption_attest">
    <label for="medical_exemption_attest" style="font-size: 10pt;">I attest that:</label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="medical_exemption_due">
    <label for="medical_exemption_due" style="font-size: 10pt;">I require a medical exemption due to 
      <span class="input-field" style="display: inline-block; width: 50%;" data-field="i_attest_that">{{ i_attest_that }}</span>.
    </label>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Non-Medical Exemption</p>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="non_medical_exemption_attest">
    <label for="non_medical_exemption_attest" style="font-size: 10pt;">I attest that:</label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="non_medical_exemption_due">
    <label for="non_medical_exemption_due" style="font-size: 10pt;">I require a non-medical exemption due to 
      <span class="input-field" style="display: inline-block; width: 50%;" data-field="i_attest_that_2">{{ i_attest_that_2 }}</span>.
    </label>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="viewed_educational_video">
    <label for="viewed_educational_video" style="font-size: 10pt;">I have viewed the educational video.</label>
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">
    Note: I understand that if I claim a non-medical exemption due to emergency use authorization (EUA) status of the COVID-19 vaccine(s), I will need to submit a new form at the time the EUA expires.
  </p>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 4: Signature</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">I understand that claiming a vaccination exemption may require I adhere to additional public health and safety requirements in the workplace (ex. wearing a face covering).</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">I attest that the statements above are true and complete. I understand that if I falsify this information I may be subject to discipline leading to and including termination.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Employee Signature: _________________________</p>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Date: _________________________</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>
</body>
</html>